		(property "Description" "H3a(c) CAN_L bypass, POPULATED by default: 0R bridging CAN_L_RJ (J1.6 / FL1.2 side) to CAN_L (U2.6 / FL1.4 side) so the default population is bypassed-continuous with FL1 DNP. EMC variant = remove R11/R12 + fit FL1. Same UNI-ROYAL 0402WGF family as the board's other 0402 R lines; C17168 read out-of-stock at LCSC retail at verification (2026-07-03) -- it is the standard JLC basic 0402 0R, any generic 0R 0402 substitutes; flag at BOM-freeze."
